// 03 - Lateral movement: WMIC remote execution
// Source   : rewritten after the challenge from the commands in report/incident-report.md,
//            to show how this stage can be surfaced. Uses only the columns confirmed
//            in my original query (TimeGenerated, DeviceName, ProcessCommandLine).
// Finds    : wmic run against another host (/node:). On the target hosts the same
//            activity appears as processes started by WmiPrvSE.exe.
// Library  : kql-detection-library/detections/lateral-movement/wmic-remote-execution.kql
// Lab scope: LOG(N) Pacific Silent Corridor training scenario; all values are synthetic.
SilentCorridorX_CL
| where ProcessCommandLine has "wmic"
| extend RemoteHost = extract(@'/node:\s*"?([^\s"]+)', 1, ProcessCommandLine)
| project TimeGenerated, DeviceName, RemoteHost, ProcessCommandLine
| order by TimeGenerated asc
